directly targets the channel with published evaluation; \cpart{} = partial, degrading, or
proxy-only coverage; \cnone{} = no published control; o.s.\ = out of scope (indirect prompt
injection). Coding and per-cell citations are in the artifact (Appendix~\ref{app:openscience}).}
\label{tab:coverage}
